              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.1+JER.27.2+JER.27.3+JER.27.4+JER.27.5+JER.27.6+JER.27.7+JER.27.8+JER.27.9+JER.27.10+JER.27.11+JER.27.12+JER.27.13+JER.27.14+JER.27.15+JER.27.16+JER.27.17+JER.27.18+JER.27.19+JER.27.20+JER.27.21+JER.27.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27.1-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.28.1+JER.28.2+JER.28.3+JER.28.4+JER.28.5+JER.28.6+JER.28.7+JER.28.8+JER.28.9+JER.28.10+JER.28.11+JER.28.12+JER.28.13+JER.28.14+JER.28.15+JER.28.16+JER.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.1-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oloo larin tikitam oobo apa Sedekia ina kata pee eaku olaiguanani, neitoreisho ninye ilarin tomon o obo te Yerusalem. Ore apa enkarna e ng'otonye naa keji Hamutal, entito e Yeremia le Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas ninye mbaa torrok too nkonyek o Laitoriani, te risioroto e nena pooki naataasa Yehoiakin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 17.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore te nkaraki engoro o Laitoriani, etabawua e rishata te Yerusalem o te Yuda, naiturrayie ninye ninche aitalam kewan. Negolong'aki Sedekia olaiguanani le Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
